.TH MYSTRLEN 3 "September 2026" "BSDSF24M043-OS-A01" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B int mystrlen(const char *str);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrlen()
function calculates and returns the number of characters in the given string.
The null terminator is not included in the returned length.
